  m_text: "<color=#FFD866><b>Fog \uC124\uC815\uD558\uB294 \uACF3</b></color>\nWindow > Rendering > <b>Lighting</b> > Environment > <b>Other Settings</b>\n\xB7 Fog \uCCB4\uD06C\n\xB7 Mode = <b>Linear</b>, Start = 4, <b>End = 20</b>\n\xB7 Color = \uC5B4\uB450\uC6B4 \uB0A8\uC0C9\n\xB7 Camera > Background Type = Solid Color, \uC548\uAC1C\uC640 \uAC19\uC740 \uC0C9\n\n<color=#9BE89B>\uCF54\uB4DC</color>\nRenderSettings.fog = true;\nRenderSettings.fogMode = FogMode.Linear;\nRenderSettings.fogEndDistance = 20f;\n\nURP \uCEE4\uC2A4\uD140 \uC170\uC774\uB354\uB294 MixFog() \uB97C \uD638\uCD9C\uD574\uC57C \uC548\uAC1C\uAC00 \uC801\uC6A9\uB428\n(URP Lit/Unlit \uC740 \uC790\uB3D9)"
